{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026B9CrLsfuuC1794908297.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台預測，一道冷鋒明日稍後橫過廣東沿岸，明晚氣溫顯著下降。<br/></p><p>天文台下午發出特別天氣提示，指冷鋒已在華南北部形成，明日稍後橫過廣東沿岸，本港會有一兩陣雨，晚上氣溫下降，隨後天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及六初時，高地風寒效應會較為明顯及寒冷，提醒戶外活動的人士，留意天氣變化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.538806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T20:33:44.526372+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:43.324899+00:00","content_hash":"a37e29b16e7cb48c1adb7f9ecd114325161a5895cd48e37f7ed514797c1f8a1a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}